  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Test d'application Shiny dans Quarto\"\n",
        "author: \"Valentin Goupille\"\n",
        "date: \"2025-04-10\"\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  html:\n",
        "    theme: cosmo\n",
        "    toc: true\n",
        "    number-sections: true\n",
        "    code-fold: true\n",
        "    fig-width: 8\n",
        "    fig-height: 6\n",
        "    fig-format: svg\n",
        "    fig-dpi: 300\n",
        "    self-contained: true\n",
        "server: shiny\n",
        "jupyter: python3\n",
        "python: venv/bin/python\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "```{=html}\n",
        "<style>\n",
        ".banner {\n",
        "  background-color: #f8f9fa;\n",
        "  padding: 20px;\n",
        "  text-align: center;\n",
        "  margin-bottom: 20px;\n",
        "  border-radius: 5px;\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        ".textbox {\n",
        "  background-color: #e9ecef;\n",
        "  padding: 15px;\n",
        "  border-left: 4px solid #6c757d;\n",
        "  margin-bottom: 20px;\n",
        "  border-radius: 0 5px 5px 0;\n",
        "}\n",
        "</style>\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "::: banner\n",
        "Créé avec ❤️ en utilisant Quarto & Shiny\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: textbox\n",
        "Cette démonstration montre comment combiner Quarto et Shiny pour créer des documents texte interactifs.\n",
        "Idéal pour les cas où vous avez besoin d'éléments interactifs tout en gardant une interface principalement textuelle.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Pellentesque venenatis lectus vel tincidunt sagittis.\n",
        "Phasellus vulputate libero vitae bibendum tincidunt.\n",
        "Curabitur pharetra, tortor quis bibendum facilisis, arcu metus consequat nisi, et ultrices risus nibh at ligula.\n",
        "Nulla tempor, justo sit amet sollicitudin sodales, est arcu dapibus nulla, eu suscipit augue mi finibus nibh.\n",
        "Quisque eget imperdiet neque. \n",
        "Curabitur justo mauris, elementum et tortor vitae, sollicitudin condimentum nisl. \n",
        "Vestibulum volutpat sapien ultricies ante rutrum, id tincidunt mi viverra. \n",
        "Quisque sodales ullamcorper quam.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### Informations supplémentaires {style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column-page\n",
        "\n",
        "```{r}\n",
        "#| message: false\n",
        "#| warning: false\n",
        "\n",
        "tib_tags <- tibble::tibble(\n",
        "  headings = c(\n",
        "    'Analyses génomiques 🧬',\n",
        "    'Phylogénie moléculaire 🌲',\n",
        "    'Analyse transcriptomique 📊',\n",
        "    'Visualisation de données 📈',\n",
        "    'Bioinformatique structurale 🔍'\n",
        "  ),\n",
        "  text = 'Duis imperdiet, est vitae mollis porttitor, neque metus ornare urna, a ullamcorper dolor sem at tellus.' \n",
        ") |> \n",
        "  dplyr::mutate(\n",
        "    headings = purrr::map(\n",
        "      headings, \n",
        "      \\(x) htmltools::div(htmltools::strong(x))\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    text = purrr::map(\n",
        "      text, \n",
        "      htmltools::div\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    combined = purrr::map2(\n",
        "      headings,\n",
        "      text,\n",
        "      \\(x, y) htmltools::div(\n",
        "        style = htmltools::css(\n",
        "          width = '300px',\n",
        "          margin_right = '20px',\n",
        "          margin_bottom = '20px'\n",
        "        ),\n",
        "        x, \n",
        "        y\n",
        "      )\n",
        "    )\n",
        "  )\n",
        "htmltools::div(\n",
        "  style = htmltools::css(\n",
        "    display = 'flex',\n",
        "    flex_wrap = 'wrap'\n",
        "  ),\n",
        "  tib_tags$combined\n",
        ")\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### Partie interactive\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "```{r}\n",
        "#| context: setup\n",
        "#| message: false\n",
        "#| warning: false\n",
        "library(bslib)\n",
        "library(ggplot2)\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{r}\n",
        "#| column: page\n",
        "layout_sidebar(\n",
        "  height = 600,\n",
        "  sidebar = sidebar(\n",
        "    shiny::selectizeInput(\n",
        "      'select_species', \n",
        "      'Espèces à mettre en évidence', \n",
        "      choices = c('Adelie', 'Chinstrap', 'Gentoo'),\n",
        "      selected = c('Adelie', 'Chinstrap', 'Gentoo'),\n",
        "      multiple = TRUE\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    shiny::sliderInput(\n",
        "      'slider_weight',\n",
        "      'Poids minimum (g)',\n",
        "      min = 1000,\n",
        "      max = 5000,\n",
        "      value = 3000\n",
        "    )\n",
        "  ),\n",
        "  shiny::plotOutput('output_plot')\n",
        ")\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{r}\n",
        "#| context: server\n",
        "# Render the plot based on user inputs\n",
        "output$output_plot <- shiny::renderPlot({\n",
        "  palmerpenguins::penguins |> \n",
        "    dplyr::filter(\n",
        "      species %in% input$select_species,\n",
        "      body_mass_g >= input$slider_weight\n",
        "    ) |> \n",
        "    ggplot(\n",
        "      aes(\n",
        "        x = bill_length_mm, \n",
        "        y = flipper_length_mm, \n",
        "        fill = species\n",
        "      )\n",
        "    ) +\n",
        "    geom_point(\n",
        "      shape = 21, \n",
        "      size = 6, \n",
        "      col = 'black'\n",
        "    ) +\n",
        "    labs(\n",
        "      x = 'Longueur du bec (mm)',\n",
        "      y = 'Longueur des nageoires (mm)',\n",
        "      fill = 'Espèce',\n",
        "      title = 'Manchots de l\\'archipel Palmer'\n",
        "    ) +\n",
        "    theme_minimal(\n",
        "      base_size = 20, \n",
        "      base_family = 'Source Sans Pro'\n",
        "    ) +\n",
        "    scale_fill_manual(\n",
        "      values = c(\n",
        "        Adelie = '#0072B2', \n",
        "        Gentoo = '#009E73',\n",
        "        Chinstrap = '#CC79A7'\n",
        "      ),\n",
        "    ) +\n",
        "    coord_cartesian(\n",
        "      xlim = c(30, 60), \n",
        "      ylim = c(170, 240)\n",
        "    )\n",
        "})\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
